# Local test data (e.g. user .fsa runs) — never committed. The raw public inputs are fetched by
# scripts/outside-data/fetch.sh. Only our own derived reference values and simulated reads are
# committed (D0010; sources and licences in PROVENANCE.md). A file under an ignored directory cannot
# be re-included, so the folder's contents are ignored rather than the folder.
test-data/*
!test-data/reference/
!test-data/sim/
